# Integer prices are ticks; no floats and no real market data.
# FIFO at the same price; the second ask survives a partial fill.
LIMIT alice SELL 10010 7 GTC
LIMIT bob SELL 10010 5 GTC
LIMIT carol BUY 10010 9 GTC
# Best price wins regardless of arrival order.
LIMIT dave SELL 10012 6 GTC
LIMIT erin SELL 10011 4 GTC
MARKET frank BUY 5
# FOK is rejected atomically; sequence and resting orders do not change.
LIMIT grace BUY 10011 100 FOK
# IOC executes available quantity, expires the remainder, and never rests.
LIMIT heidi BUY 10012 10 IOC
LIMIT ivan BUY 10000 10 POST_ONLY
LIMIT judy BUY 10000 8 GTC
# Strict reductions retain FIFO priority.
REDUCE ivan 4
MARKET mallory SELL 5
CANCEL judy
# Accepted IDs cannot be reused, including after cancellation.
LIMIT judy SELL 10005 5 GTC
# Market orders expire when there is no opposing liquidity.
MARKET oscar SELL 2
